{"id": "34601", "title": "几度夕阳红", "author": "琼瑶", "category": "文学名著", "count": 37, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/34/34601/34601s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34601.htm", "intro": "二十年来,她的生命就建筑在先生和一对乖巧的儿女身上.自从女儿晓彤在舞会中认识了魏如峰之后,\r\n　　世界似乎变小了\r\n　　从前在重庆沙坪霸的年轻岁月又重回记忆,曾经何慕天的风流才气,狂烈热情紧扣她的心,她们疯狂地爱着对方,\r\n　　使她竟可以背叛母亲毅然跟随何慕天出走,但何慕天必须回乡去解除已有的婚约,一来一往之间误会丛生,就这样过了二十年后,谁料 魏如峰的叔叔竟是何慕天,二十年平静生活又起波涛,他们之间的情,恨该如何了?如何结? ……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34601", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部", "volume": true}, {"title": "第１章", "file": "2199039.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第２章", "file": "2199040.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第３章", "file": "2199041.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第４章", "file": "2199042.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第５章", "file": "2199043.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第６章", "file": "2199044.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第７章", "file": "2199045.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第８章", "file": "2199046.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第９章", "file": "2199047.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第１０章", "file": "2199048.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第１１章", "file": "2199049.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部", "volume": true}, {"title": "第１２章", "file": "2199050.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第１３章", "file": "2199051.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第１４章", "file": "2199052.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第１５章", "file": "2199053.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第１６章", "file": "2199054.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第１７章", "file": "2199055.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第１８章", "file": "2199056.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第１９章", "file": "2199057.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第２０章", "file": "2199058.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第２１章", "file": "2199059.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第２２章", "file": "2199060.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第２３章", "file": "2199061.html", "available